{
  "id": "minimax-h3-extend-part2",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "load-guide",
      "type": "load-video",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "minimax-h3-extend-part1.mp4",
        "enable_audio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-frames",
      "type": "video-to-rgb",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_dtype": "u8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-tail",
      "type": "temporal-slice",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-frames",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "start": -90
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-guide-audio",
      "type": "load-audio",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "minimax-h3-extend-part1.mp4",
        "start_s": 6.375,
        "duration_s": 3.75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-pcm",
      "type": "audio-to-pcm",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide-audio",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_sample_rate": 32000,
        "channels": 2,
        "chunk_duration_s": 3.75,
        "max_chunk_duration_s": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "type": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "video_shift": 12,
        "audio_shift": 3,
        "condition_timestep": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model-select",
      "type": "model-select",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "hf_dir": "MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-guide",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-tail",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "video",
        "group_size": 0,
        "max_mb": 384
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-pcm",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "audio",
        "group_size": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-prompt",
      "type": "text-prompt",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the elderly clockmaker in <Video 1>, with silver hair in a loose bun, round brass-rimmed spectacles, a dark green wool cardigan over a cream blouse, and a worn brown leather apron.\n<Subject 2> is the palm-sized brass mechanical songbird in <Video 1>, made of engraved overlapping brass feather plates, with tiny ruby-glass eyes and a small silver winding key in its back.\n<Subject 3> is the candlelit clockmaker's workshop in <Video 1>, with dozens of antique wall clocks and swinging brass pendulums on dark wooden walls, a workbench of tiny gears under a green-shaded lamp, and a frost-covered window with snow falling outside.\n<Video 1> is the source video whose final moment the target video continues from.\n<Audio 1> is the synchronized audio track of <Video 1>, providing the clock ticking ambience and the celesta-and-strings score to continue.\n\nsummary:\n[video continuation + audio reference] The target video continues directly from the end of <Video 1>. In <Subject 3>, <Subject 1> holds <Subject 2> on her raised finger; after a held, silent beat the mechanical bird comes alive, sings, flies a circle through the workshop as every clock chimes at once, and settles on the frosted windowsill. The ambience and score follow <Audio 1> without copying the signal.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - her identity, silver bun, brass-rimmed spectacles, green cardigan, cream blouse, and leather apron are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the engraved brass feather plates, ruby-glass eyes, and silver winding key are retained, with the bird newly animated.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the wall of clocks, pendulums, workbench, lamp, candlelight, and snowy window are retained.\n<Video 1> (continuation starting point): fully_preserved - [Shot 1] starts from the final framing, pose, and lighting of <Video 1>.\n<Audio 1>: reference - the offset clock ticking, room tone, and celesta and low-string score continue in the same timbre and tempo without copying the original signal.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is live-action and cinematic, with warm candlelight, a shallow depth of field, and cool blue night light from the window.\n[Shot 1] The shot continues seamlessly from the final moment of <Video 1>, keeping the same static medium close-up. <Subject 1> sits on the left third of the frame, facing right, holding her index finger at eye level with <Subject 2> perched on it, while the blurred pendulums of <Subject 3> swing behind her and her spectacles reflect two small candle flames. For the first two seconds nothing moves but the flickering candles; she holds her breath, lips closed. Then the ruby eyes of <Subject 2> brighten with a faint inner glow, its head twitches sideways twice, and its brass wings unfold plate by plate with a soft whirr of tiny gears. The bird opens its beak and sings a bright, rising, flute-like trill. <Subject 1>'s eyes widen behind her spectacles and a slow smile spreads across her face.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.500, the shot cuts to a wide shot of <Subject 3>. <Subject 2> lifts off her finger and the camera follows it in a tracking shot at fast speed as it flies a full circle past the wall of clocks, candlelight glinting off its wings. As it passes, every clock begins to chime and strike together in a cascading chorus, pendulums swinging hard. Loose gears on the workbench rattle in the draft of its wings, and the green-shaded lamp sways slightly on its chain. <Subject 1> (S1) rises from her stool, looking up, laughs, and says in her soft, warm, slightly husky elderly voice: <d>[English] You remembered the song!</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.500, the shot cuts to a static close shot of the frost-covered window of <Subject 3>, snow drifting down outside in blue night light. The window frame has a small brass catch which can lift the sash. The window stays shut through the shot. <Subject 2> glides in and lands on the wooden windowsill just beside the catch, folds its brass wings with a series of tiny clicks, and then stays completely still with its head turned toward the falling snow, its ruby eyes glowing faintly against the frosted glass. The camera holds a static shot through the end of the video; nothing moves but the snow beyond the glass and the warm reflections of the candles shivering in it.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe offset ticking of many clocks and a quiet room tone referenced from <Audio 1> continue from the start, with faint candle crackle. Tiny gears whirr as the wings unfold, brass wings flutter through the air, the clocks break into overlapping chimes and strikes, a wooden stool scrapes, and the bird lands with soft metallic clicks on the windowsill, after which only the ticking and a faint draft remain.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nThe delicate celesta motif and sustained low strings referenced from <Audio 1> resume from their held chord, then rise in volume and tempo as the bird takes flight, easing back to a quiet sustained chord as it lands."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "video-ref-encoder",
      "type": "video-ref-encoder",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "text-prompt",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-guide",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "frames": 243,
        "reference_video_short_edge": 0,
        "attach_audio": [
          2
        ],
        "max_prompt_tokens": 65536,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-video",
      "type": "generate-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 2
        },
        {
          "src": "minimax-h3-model-config",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "height": 576,
        "width": 960,
        "frames": 243,
        "fps": 24,
        "steps": 21,
        "seed": 6,
        "i8_gemm": true,
        "sol_attn": false,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-vae-decode",
      "type": "audio-vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "vae-decode",
      "type": "vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "rgb-to-video",
      "type": "rgb-to-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "fps": 24,
        "pix_fmt": "yuv444p",
        "color_range": "full",
        "colorspace": "bt709"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "save-video",
      "type": "save-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "rgb-to-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "audio-vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_url": "minimax-h3-extend-part2.mp4",
        "enable_video": true,
        "enable_audio": true,
        "video_codec": "ffv1",
        "video_bitrate": 10240000,
        "video_gop_size": 24,
        "audio_codec": "alac",
        "audio_bitrate": 192000,
        "muxer_options": {
          "movflags": "+faststart"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "subpipelines": []
}